                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Really fun 1-4 players (online and offline) brawler, the controls are simple and the game is really easy to get into. but still requires skill and fast reflexes to be really good at this game. the game has many characters with different attacks and special attacks so each one plays different than the other, the movement is fluid and the controls are tight and responsive. you can test your skills with bots too in case you have no one to play against. \nhighly recommended especially with this cheap price.",
